PlayerMeasure.description:
The player (the task's `player` select, else the first active object tagged Player, else one with a PlayerInput,
else one with a CharacterController, else the root of the main camera), from its track: `x`, `y` (height, Y up),
`z` (m), `speed` (m/s), `moved` (m since the start), `dist` (m to the point `to`).
